# 统一换行符：仓库内文本文件一律 LF（Task 031 返修 R3）。
# 不依赖各机器的 core.autocrlf；Windows 上检出同样是 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不做换行转换、不做文本 diff
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.db binary
*.zip binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
